{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにやらかにやらお話したい事はたくさんあるんですが、まず謝らせてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会、れいかと一緒だったんですがあみの体調があまりすぐれなかったせいで途中椅子に座らせていただいたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しまいには最後まで出れずにリタイアしてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にファンの皆様にもそしてれいかにもご迷惑をおかけしました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももう大丈夫なので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はなにも気にせず個別握手会会待ってるからね\\(//∇//)\\❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふにゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/06/9916824/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今日は、\nいとわろたくらい寒かったのにかかわらず、たーくさん来てくれて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸が高鳴った。。↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷ ときとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆々様感謝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、あみ今回思い切ってMCをつとめさせていただいちゃったのぉーーっっ*･゜ﾟ･*:.｡..｡.:*･'(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)'･*:.｡. .｡.:*･゜ﾟ･*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいっ！？！？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩と2人でっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/06/9916824/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/06/9916824/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは基本的にまとめる事が苦手分野だからさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い切ってMCやったはいいけど、ちょこちょこ言う事忘れたりしょっぱなから緊張で噛んじゃった